{"question": "Could Russia attack a NATO country within months?", "country": "DK", "voice_speed": 0.95, "gap": 0.4, "hook": true, "hook_lines": ["NATO ATTACK IN MONTHS?", "Denmark's spies warn"], "cover": ["RUSSIA.", "NATO.", "WITHIN MONTHS?"], "region": "NATO / RUSSIA", "places": {"COPENHAGEN": {"id": "COPENHAGEN", "name": "Copenhagen", "lat": 55.68, "lon": 12.57}, "MOSCOW": {"id": "MOSCOW", "name": "Moscow", "lat": 55.75, "lon": 37.62}, "WARSAW": {"id": "WARSAW", "name": "Poland", "lat": 52.23, "lon": 21.01}, "CHISINAU": {"id": "CHISINAU", "name": "Moldova", "lat": 47.01, "lon": 28.86}, "VILNIUS": {"id": "VILNIUS", "name": "Lithuania", "lat": 54.69, "lon": 25.28}, "RIGA": {"id": "RIGA", "name": "Latvia", "lat": 56.95, "lon": 24.11}, "TALLINN": {"id": "TALLINN", "name": "Estonia", "lat": 59.44, "lon": 24.75}, "MASOVIA": {"id": "MASOVIA", "name": "Masovia, Poland", "lat": 52.4, "lon": 20.6}, "LEIPZIG": {"id": "LEIPZIG", "name": "Leipzig/Halle", "lat": 51.42, "lon": 12.24}}, "lines": [{"text": "Denmark's military intelligence says Russia could attack a NATO country within months.", "src": [0, 1], "context": false, "note": "Euronews / PA, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "COPENHAGEN", "head": "Attack within months?", "notes": ["Danish intelligence", "24 Sep 2026"], "span": 9}}, {"text": "It calls the risk low, but growing.", "src": [0, 1], "context": false, "note": "Euronews, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Risk: low.", "But growing."], "flag": "DK"}}, {"text": "Not a full invasion, which it calls highly unlikely, but a limited strike, or small numbers of troops without insignia.", "src": [0, 1], "context": false, "note": "Euronews / PA, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Invasion: unlikely.", "Limited strike: possible.", "Troops, no insignia."], "flag": "DK"}}, {"text": "Ukraine's president has named Poland, Moldova and the Baltic states as possible targets.", "src": [1], "context": false, "note": "PA, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "flow", "from": "MOSCOW", "to": ["TALLINN", "RIGA", "VILNIUS", "WARSAW", "CHISINAU"], "label": "Named by Zelensky"}}, {"text": "More likely, the agency says, is hybrid war: sabotage, cyber attacks and hits on infrastructure.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Euronews, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Sabotage.", "Cyber attacks.", "Infrastructure."], "flag": "DK"}}, {"text": "It says Russian intelligence is already recruiting ordinary Danes on social media to plan sabotage.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Euronews, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "COPENHAGEN", "head": "Recruiting Danes", "notes": ["via social media", "for sabotage"], "span": 9}}, {"text": "Overnight in Poland, a fire hit a Starlink satellite station in the Masovia region.", "src": [1], "context": false, "note": "PA, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "MASOVIA", "head": "Starlink station fire", "notes": ["overnight", "Masovia region"], "span": 9}}, {"text": "Poland's deputy prime minister says it was deliberately designed to disable the station.", "src": [1], "context": false, "note": "PA, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "quote", "quote": "deliberately designed to disable the station", "who": "Krzysztof Gawkowski, Poland", "flag": "PL"}}, {"text": "In August, Germany blamed Russia for a drone attack on Leipzig Halle airport.", "src": [2], "context": false, "note": "Euronews, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "pin", "place": "LEIPZIG", "head": "Airport drone attack", "notes": ["4 to 5 Aug 2026", "blamed on Russia"], "span": 9}}, {"text": "And France's president says a new Russian call-up of 300,000 men is a credible scenario.", "src": [3], "context": false, "note": "La Libre, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "number", "value": "300,000", "label": "possible new call-up", "detail": "Macron: credible scenario", "flag": "FR"}}, {"text": "Denmark says it does not expect a conventional attack on its own soil.", "src": [0], "context": false, "note": "Euronews, 24 Sep 2026", "scene": {"type": "statement", "lines": ["Denmark itself:", "no attack expected."], "flag": "DK"}}, {"text": "Low risk, but growing. Is Europe ready?", "src": [], "context": true, "note": "", "scene": {"type": "wide"}}], "sources": [{"n": 0, "outlet": "Euronews", "title": "Denmark says Russian invasion of NATO country 'highly unlikely' but cannot be ruled out", "url": "https://www.euronews.com/2026/09/24/denmark-says-russian-invasion-of-nato-country-highly-unlikely-but-cannot-be-ruled-out"}, {"n": 1, "outlet": "PA via Irish Examiner", "title": "Russia could attack a Nato country within months, Danish intelligence says", "url": "https://www.irishexaminer.com/world/arid-41915434.html"}, {"n": 2, "outlet": "Euronews", "title": "Macron denies France received CIA warning of Russian drone attack", "url": "https://www.euronews.com/2026/09/24/french-president-emmanuel-macron-denies-claims-the-cia-informed-france-of-a-possible-russi"}, {"n": 3, "outlet": "La Libre", "title": "Macron: new Russian mobilisation of 300,000 'a credible scenario'", "url": "https://www.lalibre.be/international/europe/guerre-ukraine-russie/2026/09/24/emmanuel-macron-declare-a-la-television-quune-nouvelle-mobilisation-russe-de-300000-hommes-est-un-scenario-qui-parait-credible-RLNT5QMVBRFD5KM3I4EZPHYQJU/"}], "caption": "Denmark's military intelligence says Russia could attack a NATO country within months. A Starlink station fire in Poland, drones over a German airport, and talk of 300,000 more Russian troops. Is Europe ready?", "hashtags": ["nato", "russia", "europe", "poland", "outpost"]}